ub.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @ethanluoyc \r\n\r\nIt appears that this issue has been resolved in JAX 0.4.26. I tested the provided code with multiple JAX versions on colab CPU, GPU and TPU. From JAX 0.4.26 onwards, JAX prefers user-requested dtype when using `jax.nn.initializers`:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport os\r\n\r\nos.environ[\"XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_MEM_FRACTION\"] = \"0.7\"\r\nos.environ[\"JAX_ENABLE_X64\"] = \"1\"\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\nprint(jax.__version__, jax.devices())\r\n_default_kernel_init = jax.nn.initializers.orthogonal(np.sqrt(2), dtype=jnp.float32)\r\nparam = _default_kernel_init(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), (5,5), jnp.float32)\r\nprint(param.dtype)\r\n```\r\nOutput:\r\n```\r\n0.4.26 [CpuDevice(id=0)]\r\nfloat32\r\n```\r\nAttaching the [gist](https://colab.sandbox.google.com/gist/rajasekharporeddy/89f7b5cad114fdb4f93173edb487c574/-18267.ipynb) for reference.\r\n\r\nThank you.","created_at":"2024-05-27T12:22:09Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/18267#issuecomment-2133369400","id":2133369400,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18267","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5_KKI4","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2133369400/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-05-27T12:34:45Z","url":"https://api.github